//// json-parse-type-argument-public-test-suite/README.md
`files.json` holds the files of `test_parsing/` and `test_transform/` of [nst/JSONTestSuite](https://github.com/nst/JSONTestSuite) at commit 1ef36fa01286573e846ac449e8683f8833c5b26a, each in base64, because many of them are not UTF-8; a long file that repeats a few bytes is stored as those bytes, a count and what follows. `LICENSE` is that repository's license (MIT). `generate.ts` writes `files.json` and `fitted.ts` from a clone.
